Explain the role of providers and how they map to specific target APIs.
Locate and consume community-contributed or official plugins. [1]
4. Use the Terraform CLI outside of Core Workflows (~10%) [1, 2]
Execute utility subcommands such as terraform fmt, terraform validate, and terraform output.
